IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-OPENCLAW-ORCH.

DATA DIVISION.
01 NUM-AGENTS          PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 DELEGATIONS         PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 CONFLICTS           PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 THROUGHPUT-LIFT-X100 PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-OPENCLAW-ORCH.
    IF NUM-AGENTS == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE NUM-AGENTS TO DELEGATIONS.
    MULTIPLY 3 BY DELEGATIONS.

    MOVE NUM-AGENTS TO CONFLICTS.
    DIVIDE 2 INTO CONFLICTS.

    MOVE 285 TO THROUGHPUT-LIFT-X100.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 NUM-AGENTS.
    WEIGHT 30 DELEGATIONS.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
